# Local-by-nature skill references — created from *.template.md, never committed
skills/*/references/environment.md
skills/*/references/review-checklists.md
skills/*/references/agent-trust-profiles.md

# Machine-local helper scripts an installer may overlay into a skill
# (no trailing slash: the overlay may be a symlink, which a dir-only
# pattern would not match)
skills/*/scripts
